			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "223f6be7-e6ef-44b1-b40b-994585335f14")
	)
	(text "(check):\n- Footprint: KiCad's default for this symbol, Package_SO:TSSOP-10_3x3mm_P0.5mm. Compare with TI's DGS land\n  pattern (MSOP-10_3x3mm_P0.5mm is the alternative).\n- OD_CLAMP and rated voltage for the VG0832012 are firmware settings; keep battery current under the nPM1304 limit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
